   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">⚠️ The university has <strong>not published a syllabus for DMA302m</strong> on FLM. This framework follows the official syllabus of the <strong>same-named subject DMA301m</strong> (syllabus 12278) as the closest reference — check with your lecturer for anything specific to DMA302m.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">⚠️ Trường <strong>chưa công bố syllabus cho DMA302m</strong> trên FLM. Khung dưới đây theo syllabus chính thức của <strong>môn cùng tên DMA301m</strong> (syllabus 12278) làm tham khảo gần nhất — điều gì riêng của DMA302m thì hỏi giảng viên.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DMA302m · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Digital Marketing Analytics — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 12278 (subject DMA301m, used as reference) · Decision 1363/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 06/12/2024 · collected 09/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DMA302m · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Digital Marketing Analytics — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 12278 (môn DMA301m, dùng làm tham khảo) · QĐ 1363/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 06/12/2024 · thu ngày 09/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">DMA301m</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Digital Marketing Analytics_Phân tích marketing số</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h)<br><br>= 45h contact hours + 105h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">DMS301m/MKT318m</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Blended,Presenting,Project based learning,Social Constructivism,discussion</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">12278</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">1363/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/06/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">12/6/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">DMA301m</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Digital Marketing Analytics_Phân tích marketing số</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h)<br><br>= 45h contact hours + 105h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">DMS301m/MKT318m</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Blended,Presenting,Project based learning,Social Constructivism,discussion</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">12278</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">1363/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/06/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">12/6/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>This Course is based on the Coursera Specialization &quot;Digital Marketing&quot; and Google Digital Marketing &amp; E-commerce Certificat Professionnel, which covers both the dynamics and the global aspects of digital marketing. You'll learn how to attract customers using various digital channels, measure marketing performance through analytics, and manage e-commerce stores to boost customer loyalty.<br><br>*Teaching method: This is a blended-learning course, in which students will take a look at the videos &amp; slides and reading on Coursera first at home, then rewatch &amp; discuss key questions with classmates and teachers at classes.<br><br>Students will use AI tools and applications to:<br><br>- support generating and refining ideas<br><br>- assist in content suggestions,<br><br>- assist in answering questions on Edunext, in-class discussions, and identifying credible sources.<br><br>- supports summarizing and concluding research findings through data-driven insights and structured templates.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>This Course is based on the Coursera Specialization &quot;Digital Marketing&quot; and Google Digital Marketing &amp; E-commerce Certificat Professionnel, which covers both the dynamics and the global aspects of digital marketing. You'll learn how to attract customers using various digital channels, measure marketing performance through analytics, and manage e-commerce stores to boost customer loyalty.<br><br>*Teaching method: This is a blended-learning course, in which students will take a look at the videos &amp; slides and reading on Coursera first at home, then rewatch &amp; discuss key questions with classmates and teachers at classes.<br><br>Students will use AI tools and applications to:<br><br>- support generating and refining ideas<br><br>- assist in content suggestions,<br><br>- assist in answering questions on Edunext, in-class discussions, and identifying credible sources.<br><br>- supports summarizing and concluding research findings through data-driven insights and structured templates.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12278\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12278</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12278\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12278</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
